OL,3,GNEWSABurglar caught napping in victim's
OL,4,Ahome is jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA balaclava-clad burglar who fell
OL,7,Fasleep in a victim's home has been
OL,8,Fjailed.
OL,10,FNelson Loveridge broke into a property
OL,11,Fin Hemel Hempstead, Hertfordshire, on
OL,12,F19 April before falling asleep in a
OL,13,Fspare room.
OL,15,FThe 36-year-old, of Honeycross Road in
OL,16,Fthe town, was found snoozing by a man
OL,17,Fin the house in Long Chaulden at about
OL,18,F7:30 BST before being woken and
OL,19,Farrested.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
